---
// Quiz figure for Post 6: 4-quarter divergence between Net Profit and Operating Cash Flow (CFO).
---
<div class="qfig-sbq06cf">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="4-quarter table comparing Net Profit (+40B, +50B, +55B, +55B = +200B cumulative) against Operating Cash Flow (−30B, −45B, −50B, −55B = −180B cumulative) alongside surging receivables.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4-Quarter Comparison: Net Profit vs Operating Cash Flow (B)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>So sánh 4 quý: Lãi ròng và Dòng tiền kinh doanh CFO (tỷ đồng)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="548" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="34" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Metric</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ tiêu</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="230" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">Q1</text>
    <text x="305" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">Q2</text>
    <text x="380" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">Q3</text>
    <text x="455" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">Q4</text>
    <text x="546" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">Total</text>

    <text x="34" y="106">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Net Profit (LNST)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi ròng (LNST)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="230" y="106" text-anchor="end">+40</text>
    <text x="305" y="106" text-anchor="end">+50</text>
    <text x="380" y="106" text-anchor="end">+55</text>
    <text x="455" y="106" text-anchor="end">+55</text>
    <text x="546" y="106" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t">+200</text>

    <text x="34" y="136" class="qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Operating CF (CFO)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dòng tiền CFO</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="230" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-red">−30</text>
    <text x="305" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-red">−45</text>
    <text x="380" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-red">−50</text>
    <text x="455" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-red">−55</text>
    <text x="546" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="qfig-t qfig-red">−180</text>

    <text x="34" y="158" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Trade receivables grew from 120B (Q1) to 510B (Q4).</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phải thu khách hàng tăng vọt từ 120 tỷ (Q1) lên 510 tỷ (Q4).</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq06cf { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq06cf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq06cf text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq06cf .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06cf .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06cf .qfig-m { font-size: 11.8px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq06cf .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq06cf .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
</style>
